description_text:
A military balaclava available in four different colors sets:

  - khaki,

  - green camouflage,

  - grey camouflage,

  - black one.The file contains of:

  - Zprj project (suitable for Marvelous Designer/ Clo3d);

  - FBX file of the Garnment (Triangulated, Thin/Unweld) with backed UVs' 4096 x 4096;

  - OBJ file of the Garnment (Triangulated, Thick, Unweld) with backed UVs' 4096 x 4096;

  - OBJ file of the Stitches (Triangulated, Thick). Stitches are separate mesh (green lines on the screenshot);

  - Textures pack. Baked maps are made in Clo3d. No retopology. Not for Procreate

Detailed Low Poly model of WW2 British commando knife.

  - Fit for any PBR game;

  - Textures included Base Color, Height, Metallic, Normal and Roughness;

  - Include Unity package;

  - 4096x4096 high quality texture maps;

  - Low Poly Triangles;

File Formats: .Max2014 .FBX .OBJ .3DS

Blacksmith's sledgehammer in sci-fi and cartoon style
Blacksmith sledgehammer  in sci-fi and cartoon style. Options are included with anti-aliasing and without. The color of the material and the scratches on the metal surface are done through procedural nodes in Blender.
Included file formats:

  - Alembic (.abc);

  - Collada (.dae);

  - FBX (.fbx);

  - Stanford(.ply);

  - Stereolithography (.stl);

  - Wavefront (.obj, .mtl);

  - X3D (.x3d).

  - vertices  2261

  - faces 1839

Electro Magnetic Pulse  Grenade
The sci-fi electro magnetic pulse grenade has an activation button and triangular indicators: blue and red that glow. In the Blender file, you can change the color of the indicators. The bottom of the grenade is flat so that it can stand.
Included file formats:

  - Alembic(.abc);

  - Collada(.dae);

  - FBX(.fbx);

  - Stanford(.ply);

  - Stereolithography(.stl);

  - Wavefront(.obj, .mtl);

  - X3D(.x3d).

  - vertices 4163

  - faces 4151

This pack includes 5 low-poly medieval swords with PBR textures for Games and CGI.
Include FBX files with textures in 4K. The pack also includes Unity(HDRP and URP) and UE4 versions.
The polycount is within 4000-4800 triangles, only Rust sword contain 6358 tris.
Each sword contains the following textures:

  - BaseColor map;

  - Normal map;

  - Metallic map;

  - Roughness map;

  - Mask map for HDRP(Smothness & Metallic);

  - Mask map for URP(Smothness & Metallic);

  - Mask map fo Unreal Engine 4&5(Roughness & Metallic);

With 6 different download formats you are sure to find the right 3D object format for your project, This a 3D model of Jinx Canon Inspired From the video game League Of Legends, Project was made in 2 days If u encountred any issue feel free to contact me
